"The Nameless Hell Hound is a birth transmigrator from Earth's integration."
"The Nameless Hell Hound carries the memories of Lisha, a lonely rich Earth girl of about fourteen."
"Lisha died very cold, struck by the falling bright thing, and saw a bright light."
"The Nameless Hell Hound also recalls being the puppy Lisha rescued from the snow."
"Those clashing memories give the Nameless Hell Hound splitting headaches."
"The Nameless Hell Hound holds that she only has Lisha's memories, and refuses to be called Lisha."
"The Nameless Hell Hound thinks in English and wrote \"Earth\" in the dirt for Genzo."
"The Umarii Oracle knew a transmigrator was among the Hell Hound pups before any were taken."
"The Oracle judged the Bloody Peaks attack could not have stopped that transmigrator's birth."
"The Oracle moves Themiel, who moves Luke, who moves the Hell Hound transmigrator."
"Elva Wyrmscar of the Bloody Peaks is secretly Jessica, a death transmigrator from Earth."
"Elva, thirteen, died falling from a Direwing, and Jessica woke in her body."
"Jessica was sixteen on Earth, visiting family in Utah, when a meteor killed her."
"On Earth Jessica's mother was dead and her father worked at an oil refinery."
"Jessica's brother, three years older, had left for army basic training before she died."
"Jessica worked out from the names Ben and Jerry that Iris's strange sister came from Earth."
"Genzo the frog man is a transmigrator from another world, born a tadpole."
"Genzo died on his own world the same way, by a falling bright thing."
"Genzo knew the Nameless Hell Hound for a transmigrator at first meeting."
"The Umarii Oracle is a birth transmigrator who remembers much of her past life."
"The Oracle's old world, Xanathu, had a toxic surface, and its people lived in cities underground."
"Xanathu had solar machines and computers under its people's control, and it had chess."
"The binder's question of a toxic fog above the surface seems to match Xanathu."
"A councillor who called the Oracle \"Astrid\" had his head burst by her finger flick."
"The Skeleton Night Sentry of the Cursed City was an Earth transmigrator in a skeleton body."
"On Earth the Sentry was a hitwoman for an agency, on death row when a meteor hit her prison yard."
"The Sentry had spent four or five months alone in the Cursed City before she died."
"The Nameless Hell Hound killed her and earned \"Oops, was that important?\""
"That garbled reward text also showed when Kenshaw nearly burned the Nameless Hell Hound alive."
"Sakura Aoyama, an Iron March spy, may be a transmigrator from world 15 or 19."
"Sakura vaguely recalls lost boys and a girl sewing a shadow back on."
"Sakura answered \"plastic\" for what mourning masks are made of."
"General Hakimo saw in Sakura a sign of world 14, Earth."
"The other-life question troubled Sakura, and Rin Zaoh ended the interview early."
"Rin Zaoh knows of transmigrators through Genzo and knows other Earthlings."
"Rin Zaoh offered the Nameless Hell Hound a meeting with other Earthlings, and she declined."
"The Umarii Oracle sent Themiel and Luke into the wastes to find the Hell Hound transmigrator."
"Genzo warned the Nameless Hell Hound that the Umarii hunt transmigrators."
